su name see ob text prompt from filename image to name text output be ceremony def
  ob text "mkdir -p artifacts/see" be command do
  ob text of ob of this to filename "artifacts/see/prompt.txt" be write do
  exists su name cmd ob text "node command/see_vl_runner.mjs" be text ya
  ob text " --prompt-file \"artifacts/see/prompt.txt\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob text " --image \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob filename of from of this to name text image path be text do
  ob name image path to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name ollama host to name text host be text do
  ob text " --host \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name host to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name see model to name text model be text do
  ob text " --model \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name model to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob text of cmd to name text output be command do
  su name output ret
prah

exists su name see be export ya
